   "speech": "Roumier’s researches in the fields of colour photography and hypnosis, two such different departments of inquiring endeavour, having achieved considerable success, had thereby created for the persistent scholar a numerous and ceaselessly growing circle of admirers. For this reason the doorbell was Roumier’s tormentor, and on the day in question he listened in anguish to its twentieth rattle, remarking to his manservant that, unless the visitor showed particular insistence, it would not be amiss to remind him that the doctor’s consulting hour would end in five minutes.",
